2. Climb Every Mountain
3. A House Is Not A Home
4. Get Here
5. Who’s Loving You
6. Fallin’
7. I surrender
8. Wind Beneath My Wings
9. Ain’t No Sunshine
10. Nature Boy
11. Contigo En La Distancia
12. Star-Spangled
